sequenceDiagram
    actor Employee
    participant UI as Employee Chat UI
    participant API as NestJS API
    participant DB as Application DB
    participant Realtime as Socket.IO
    participant Admin as HR Admin Console

    Employee->>UI: Asks unresolved or sensitive question
    UI->>API: Send message
    API->>DB: Store message
    API->>API: Determine handover should be offered
    API->>DB: Mark session as handover offered
    API->>Realtime: Notify employee and HR admin channels
    API-->>UI: Return handover offer
    Employee->>UI: Accepts HR handover
    UI->>API: Confirm handover
    API->>DB: Mark session as open handover
    API->>Realtime: Notify HR admin escalation view
    Admin->>API: Sends HR reply
    API->>DB: Store HR message
    API->>Realtime: Deliver HR reply to employee
    UI-->>Employee: Shows HR response in same thread

